Complete originating-theorem audit of the construction target.
Run the explicit InferenceConstruction module build before this audit; the
existing default target alone does not establish this import surface.
The wider audit uses the documented local -M1536 allowance. Ordinary proof
builds retain -j1 -M1024. Exact types and transitive axioms are printed for
all originating theorem constants, including private/generated names.
Kernel acceptance does not discharge missing source/native premises.
-/
